& [OfficialOpenAIDocumentation]
  + [index] https://developers.openai.com/codex/llms.txt routes to the official Codex documentation set
  + [page] https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/app-server is the official Codex App Server protocol page captured on 2026-08-23
  + App Server is the interface used by rich Codex clients and its implementation is identified as open source
  + official local command shape is codex app-server
  + default transport is stdio using newline-delimited JSON
  + protocol is bidirectional JSON-RPC 2.0 with the jsonrpc header omitted on the wire
  + a connection must send one initialize request followed by one initialized notification before other methods
  + official version-specific schema generation commands are app-server generate-ts and app-server generate-json-schema with an explicit output directory
  + WebSocket transport is documented as experimental and unsupported for production so it is excluded from the B1 candidate
  + documentation establishes protocol family and command vocabulary but not this machine's selected executable identity generated schema digest sandbox enforcement or read-only consequence

